umul-m: x * y, for x and y from 0 to 999 with x * y <= 999.
Cells 72-98. To call it, put y in cell 96, load x into the accumulator and JMP 72.
It returns x * y in the accumulator.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99, including y in cell 96 (made the smaller operand and counted down to 0).
Size 27 cells. It runs at most 267 instructions, 52.8 on average, counted from cell 72 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

